OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidely cloudy to start but any
OL,6,Frain limited to the south. Cloud
OL,7,Fbreaking a little into the afternoon
OL,8,Fwith the odd light shower.
OL,9,FTemperatures near average by day,
OL,10,Fturning chillier overnight. Breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FLargely dry overnight but
OL,13,Fwith the odd light shower possible,
OL,14,Fparticularly over East Anglia.
OL,15,FBecoming dry away from the coast by
OL,16,Fdawn with clear spells. Chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
