OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA dry, bright and largely
OL,6,Fsunny day across the region. Showery
OL,7,Fin the east however, and becoming
OL,8,Fbreezy here too. Cold and frosty
OL,9,Fovernight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FA cold
OL,12,Fand frosty start on Friday, but a dry
OL,13,Fday with sunshine. Becoming cold again
OL,14,Fovernight under clear skies. Turning
OL,15,Fcloudier and less cold from Saturday,
OL,16,Fbut remaining dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
